WEBVTT

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.880
Previously on <i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.430
I came to Japan with my dream
to become a school idol. But...

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.140
We got rejected.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:15.430
We were defeated by Ren Hazuki-<i>san</i>'s
frigid attitude towards school idols.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.470
"School Withdrawal Application"

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.470
We were defeated by Ren Hazuki-<i>san</i>'s
frigid attitude towards school idols.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.390
We were defeated by Ren Hazuki-<i>san</i>'s
frigid attitude towards school idols.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:19.760
"Let's be school idols"

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:19.760
We were defeated by Ren Hazuki-<i>san</i>'s
frigid attitude towards school idols.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.930
"Let's be school idols"

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.930
It's wrong that we cannot
freely pursue club activities!

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:23.480
It's wrong that we cannot
freely pursue club activities!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:27.360
Two of the girls understood
my passion and helped me out.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.150
We're not going to give up.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.900
In order to continue being school idols,

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.820
we have to place first at an event
at the end of the month!

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.410
The new me...

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.910
...gets to start!

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.460
Kanon-<i>san</i>?

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.550
S-Sorry. I was just a little startled.

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:54.050
I'm gonna sing!

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.260
Kanon-<i>san</i>, could it be...

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.680
Nope! I'm fine! Totally fine!

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.190
Wait... What?!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:13.150
<i>You can't stop real dreams</i>

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:18.870
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:23.120
"Love Live! Superstar!!"

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:39.930
<i>Before we knew it,</i>
<i>we found something that we loved</i>

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:43.430
<i>Let these feelings reach you</i>

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:46.100
<i>We've made up our minds, we're serious!</i>

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.900
<i>I wonder what we can do</i>

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.810
<i>The sky's so bright</i>

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:56.240
<i>Let's look up at it</i>
<i>and sing our hearts out</i>

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:00.320
<i>Doesn't having something you want to do</i>

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.990
<i>Make every day fun?</i>

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:08.080
<i>Do you feel that way, too?</i>

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.380
<i>Ah, we've been waiting for this moment</i>

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.420
<i>This encounter is where we start</i>

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:18.800
<i>Our dreams are drawn together,</i>
<i>and it all begins</i>

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:24.600
<i>We realized our true desires and now,</i>
<i>we can't be stopped</i>

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:29.980
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:35.820
<i>As fast as they can run</i>

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:37.690
"Kuukaa"

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.280
"Kuukaa"

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.280
You couldn't do it after all?!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.320
"Kuukaa"

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.320
Yeah.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.530
But you've always been able
to sing when it didn't count.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:47.790
I thought I'd be okay since it was morning
and not many people were around...

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.420
Did your problem actually get worse?

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.290
Possibly.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:55.050
We have to place first at that fes, too...

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.670
Sis...

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.510
Perhaps you should just give up.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:04.300
If you embarrass yourselves at that fes,
it'll harm our school's reputation.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.890
We don't know for sure
that she won't be able to sing.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.100
I have my doubts.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.980
Anyway, we're just
going to do what we can.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:14.810
We still have time, and the director
gave them her blessing.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.900
There's no problem.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:21.530
I truly hope this doesn't interfere
with your dance practice, Arashi-<i>san</i>.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.030
I'm sorry, Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:29.250
No, don't apologize! I've definitely
been practicing my dance.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:32.000
I know! Do you have
some time after school?

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.170
<i>Takoyaki?!</i>

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:39.880
Wow! It looks so yummy!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.930
What does this have to do with
me not being able to sing?

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.180
The times you couldn't sing were either

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.640
when you were in front of people
or on a big stage.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.520
But this time...

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.190
The real reason is
the pressure you're feeling!

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.310
This added pressure of
having to place first at this fes

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.730
was created within you, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:58.980
Which means...

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.900
Welcome! Wait, why?!

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.120
Let's do some <i>takoyaki </i>training!

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.410
I'm sure you help out at your café,

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:11.040
but you might be able to change if you're
in a situation you're not used to.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:14.960
Whenever you're making <i>takoyaki</i>,
you're being watched a lot of the time.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:18.170
--Meaning, you're working while
the customers watch you.

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:19.340
--It looks so good! It looks so good!
--Meaning, you're working while
the customers watch you.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.090
--It looks so good! It looks so good!
--I see.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:25.800
If you can successfully make
some <i>takoyaki </i>under that pressure...

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.350
I might be able to sing...

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.680
You might be able to sing...

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.310
You might be able to sing...

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:32.230
I might be able to sing...

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.190
Or not.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.770
Welf, I gwuess finging ish diffwent.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:41.320
Guess it's not that easy after all.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.780
Costumes?

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.860
You'll look great in anything, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:48.490
I'm sure if you wear something cute,
you'll feel better and be able to sing.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.780
It'd be great if that's the case.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.700
Let's have you try on my recommendation!

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.040
So excited!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.630
I'm going to wear this... onstage?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.250
So excited!

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.420
What's the matter?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.550
Er, I was just thinking...
how cute this is.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:08.430
I know, right?!

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:09.680
Show us, already!

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.010
I haven't worn it yet.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.930
--Why?!
--Oh, you must want some accessories, too!

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.190
--Oh, I see!
--Uh... What?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:18.690
I think this will look the best on you.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.570
I think this color will
look nice on her, too.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:23.740
I see. Then let's give this a try...

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:26.780
Um, hello?

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:28.780
Sure, here you go.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.290
That's not what I meant.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:36.620
I mean this outfit is
too cute for me to wear!

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.620
Charge!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.170
Hiyah!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.340
You look lovely!

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:46.840
Thanks, I guess...

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.970
Okay, I'm taking it.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:48.890
What?!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.600
Look this way!

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.060
O-Okay...

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.560
Now, look up this way.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.850
L-Like this?

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.100
Yes! That's perfect!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.770
So cute! So cute!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.480
So cute! So cute!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.690
I can't take it!

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.860
Delete that.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.320
Oh, it's fine.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:12.780
I'm just going to upload them onto
the internet and get tons of likes.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.910
That's not fine at all!

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.040
I just can't!

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.960
If that's all it took for me to sing,
I would've been able to by now.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.000
You'll definitely be able
to sing, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.510
I witnessed that moment myself!

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:31.640
That was just by chance.
This must be the real me, though.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.600
No need to be gloomy!

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:38.180
The only reason I'm able to work so hard
right now is because you were by my side.

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:39.770
Keke-<i>chan</i>...

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:43.480
But I was able to sing in front of people
once, and now, we're back to this.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:45.780
I just don't know what to do.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:50.160
All right. Then let's stop trying
to force you to sing right now.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.740
I'll sing by myself
in this upcoming performance.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.620
I'm not as good of a singer
as you are, Kanon-<i>san</i>...

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.870
But you can just stand up
on that stage with me.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.290
Let's do everything we can
for this performance together!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:06.590
Once that's done, you can try
even harder to sing again.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:08.760
I promised you.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:12.800
I promised I won't give up
until you can sing, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.180
Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.270
Keke-<i>chan</i>'s this serious about it.

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:21.520
You're right.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.440
Our top priority is
placing first together!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.520
I'll do everything I can
to make it an amazing performance!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.230
Yes!

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:33.070
Now that that's settled, there's something
I'd like to show you two.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.830
Ta-da!

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.210
What do you think?

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.830
What is this?

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:44.210
Since our first show is coming up,

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:47.380
I've prepared a sign with our
group name on it and some blades!

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.920
Aren't the fans supposed to
have those blades?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:54.300
I'm thinking about handing them out!
To everyone who might support us!

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.970
What exactly is "Kuukaa"?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.270
It's the group name I thought up!

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.480
I took the "Kuu" from Keke

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:04.190
and "Kaa" from your name and
mashed them together to make "Kuukaa."

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.190
I'm not sure about this.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:08.570
But, wow. You actually
made this while training.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:09.940
It was my pleasure.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:13.280
Let's... maybe rethink the sign.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.290
So this is where we're going to perform.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:31.090
Apparently, there will be about
ten groups performing in total.

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:35.050
And we have to place first out of them.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.340
--Yes!
--Yes!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.140
Yes!

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.510
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.970
Bye-bye!

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.900
I'm sure Keke-<i>chan </i>would be
better off without me...

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:53.280
Wait! It's Sunny Pas!

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.490
No way!

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.700
You're right! They're joining
at the last minute!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.580
Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.580
What's the matter?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.710
You won't believe it! It's Sunny Pas!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:13.210
The super school idol group
from Kozushima, Sunny Passion!

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.890
And now, Sunny Passion will be at our fes!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.970
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.520
So precious!

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.860
You have this giant poster at home?

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:31.150
But of course!

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:36.490
The reason I wanted to come to Japan
is because I saw their concert!

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:40.160
She can warm up your heart
with the brightness of a sunflower.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.040
Sunny Pas's sun, Yuuna Hijirisawa-<i>sama</i>.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.660
She astounds us with her
unmatched beauty and elegance.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:49.130
Sunny Pas's Sexy Night...
Mao Hiiragi-<i>sama</i>.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.960
They're that amazing, huh?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.170
And they're going to perform
at the fes you're in?

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:56.470
Yes! Very suddenly!

00:09:56.470 --> 00:10:02.010
Oh, I can't believe we're going to be on
the same stage as Sunny Pas-<i>sama</i>!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.520
Yeah, they're definitely
last year's Tokyo reps, all right.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.230
They're on another level.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:13.730
If they're competing,
they'll probably get first place...

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:14.980
Of course, they will!

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:18.740
Sunny Pas will definitely
place first at this fes!

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:23.700
But in order for Kanon-<i>san </i>and I
to continue being school idols...

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:26.870
We have to place first at this fes...

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.340
You finally got it?

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.170
Looks like it.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:37.760
I don't think we can win.

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.300
What should we do?

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.050
You have five days until the show.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.930
I'm sure making your practices
a bit harder won't exactly help...

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:50.020
And we have to keep in mind that
Keke-<i>chan</i>'s going to sing everything.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.150
I'm sorry.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:56.230
It's okay! I can support you,
Kanon-<i>san</i>! Just watch!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:01.530
One, two, three.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:05.700
See? After practicing every day,
I've gotten much better.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:12.130
If I keep this up, I'm sure that
everything will be perfect at our show!

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.670
Well, I'm heading home.

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:16.880
Chi-<i>chan</i>?

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:21.220
It's getting pretty late.
I've got dance practice after dinner.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:24.640
And... the time you two spend
together is important, too.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:27.140
It's you two that'll be
standing on that stage.

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.140
See you later.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.770
I'm sorry. Please excuse me for a moment.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.070
Chisato-<i>san</i>!

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.280
What's up?

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:47.330
Um... I know this may sound weird
all of a sudden, but...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:51.040
Are you interested in
school idols, Chisato-<i>san</i>?

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:53.420
I am.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:54.420
Really?!

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.460
But...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:58.550
I have dance.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:02.720
My biggest goal right now is to
make a name for myself as a dancer.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:06.050
I don't have time to
try to balance out both.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.890
Kanon-<i>chan</i>'s really serious
about this, too,

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.680
so I can't participate
with lukewarm feelings.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.560
I'm sorry.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.480
No, I'm sorry.

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:19.230
I just thought Kanon-<i>san </i>would be
really happy if you joined us.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.570
Thanks.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.910
Hello?

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.540
Were you able to take that call okay?

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:38.380
Yes. My older sister was worried about me.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:41.170
I see. That's nice of her.

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.840
I guess I'll head home, too.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.930
Um!

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:50.140
I actually just invited
Chisato-<i>san </i>to join us again.

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:53.180
But she said she has dancing
to concentrate on...

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:54.480
I see.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:57.810
But please don't get the wrong idea!

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.650
I want to stand on the same stage as you!

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:03.240
That hasn't changed!

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.490
Yeah... That makes me really happy.

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:09.700
But I was thinking...

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:13.620
At this rate, it's going to be really hard
for us to get first place.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:17.790
Meaning, your dreams
might come to an end...

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.500
Because of me.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:25.380
You came here all the way from Shanghai
because you wanted to do something.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.430
Your dreams have just begun...

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.390
And if...

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:37.150
And if you have to give up
on those dreams because of me...

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.400
I would never be able to apologize enough!

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.690
I'm just holding you back!

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:47.990
I can't get up on that stage knowing that!

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:55.750
I'm sorry, Keke-<i>chan</i>. I'm sorry!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:59.790
Please don't talk so badly about yourself.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:04.340
I'd have to pity myself
because you stole my heart then.

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:12.760
My family is very strict with academics,
so all I ever did was study.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:15.680
